    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR extends the udb gem’s existing “prebuilt Z3 download” approach to also manage `espresso` and `must` as prebuilt GitHub release assets, so gem users don’t need local toolchains and call sites can use absolute tool paths.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add pinned tool version files and Ruby helpers to locate/download `espresso` and `must` binaries under `~/.cache/udb/...`.\n- Add `extconf.rb` installers for `espresso` and `must` and wire them into the gemspec extensions list.\n- Update logic call sites and the devcontainer to stop relying on locally-built `espresso`/`must`.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 16 out of 17 changed files in this pull request and generated 10 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tools/scripts/README_build_must.md | Documents Docker-based static build & release process for `must`. |\r\n| tools/scripts/README_build_espresso.md | Documents Docker-based static build & release process for `espresso`. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/udb.gemspec | Adds espresso/must extconf installers and version files to the gem package/extensions. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/must_version.rb | Introduces `Udb::MUST_VERSION` constant wrapper. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/must_path.rb | Adds `Udb::MustPath.binary` helper to find/download the `must` executable. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/logic.rb | Switches `must`/`espresso` invocations to use absolute paths from helper modules. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/espresso_version.rb | Introduces `Udb::ESPRESSO_VERSION` constant wrapper. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/espresso_path.rb | Adds `Udb::EspressoPath.binary` helper to find/download the `espresso` executable. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/MUST_VERSION | Pins the GitHub release tag used for `must` assets. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/ESPRESSO_VERSION | Pins the GitHub release tag used for `espresso` assets. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/ext/udb_must_download/extconf.rb | Downloads `must` at gem install time via extconf. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/ext/udb_espresso_download/extconf.rb | Downloads `espresso` at gem install time via extconf. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/REUSE.toml | Adds the new version-pin files to the REUSE ignore list. |\r\n| bin/.container-tag | Bumps container tag version. |\r\n| .pre-commit-config.yaml | Updates EOF fixer exclusions to include the new version-pin files. |\r\n| .github/workflows/build-z3.yml | Removes the standalone Z3 build workflow. |\r\n| .devcontainer/Dockerfile | Removes manual `espresso`/`must` build/install steps from the devcontainer image. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
